sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Static frontend
    participant API as HTTP API + token authorizer
    participant S3 as Private source S3
    participant Q as SQS
    participant Dispatch as Dispatcher Lambda
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant SF as Standard Step Functions
    participant Tasks as Image task Lambdas
    participant Dest as Private result S3
    participant SNS as SNS notifications
    participant CDN as CloudFront
    User->>UI: Select image and provide demo token
    UI->>API: POST /uploads (MIME, exact size)
    API->>DB: Create AWAITING_UPLOAD job
    API-->>UI: Five-minute presigned POST + job ID
    UI->>S3: Upload original directly
    S3->>Q: ObjectCreated with version ID
    Q->>Dispatch: Batched, at-least-once delivery
    Dispatch->>DB: Pin one source version; set QUEUED
    Dispatch->>SF: StartExecution (name = job ID)
    Note over Dispatch,SF: Stable name and input make retries idempotent
    SF->>Tasks: Validate
    Tasks->>S3: Read pinned version
    Tasks->>DB: PROCESSING + extracted dimensions
    SF->>Tasks: Resize thumbnail and large image
    Tasks->>Dest: Write private intermediates
    SF->>Tasks: Watermark
    Tasks->>Dest: Read/write intermediates
    SF->>Tasks: Store
    Tasks->>Dest: Copy final JPEGs into images prefix
    Tasks->>DB: Set COMPLETED
    SF->>SNS: Publish completion
    loop Every three seconds until terminal state
        UI->>API: GET /jobs/job_id
        API->>DB: Consistent read
        API-->>UI: Job status (output URLs when complete)
    end
    UI->>CDN: GET output images
    CDN->>Dest: OAC-signed origin request (cache miss only)
    CDN-->>UI: Cached JPEGs
